OL,3,GNEWSANew viewing point opens at 19th
OL,4,ACentury quarry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new purpose-built viewing platform
OL,7,Ffor an active 19th Century quarry in
OL,8,FLeicestershire has opened.
OL,10,FThe land around the viewpoint, off
OL,11,FKinchley Lane, south west of
OL,12,FMountsorrel Quarry, was restored with
OL,13,F8,250 trees and 550m (1,804ft) of
OL,14,Fhedgerow in 2022.
OL,16,FOperator Tarmac said new footpaths had
OL,17,Falso been created alongside information
OL,18,Fboards for visitors to learn more about
OL,19,Fthe area's geology, history and
OL,20,Frestoration.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
